# STEP B3 — INTEGRATION ANALYSIS

## B3.1: REST API

If `@RestResource` present:
```bash
grep -rln "apexrest/[urlMapping]" src/
grep -rln "apexrest/[urlMapping]" force-app/
```

## B3.2: Invocable Methods

If `@InvocableMethod` present:
```bash
find force-app -name "*.flow-meta.xml" -exec grep -l "ChangedClass" {} \;
find force-app -name "*.flow-meta.xml" -exec grep -l "changedMethod" {} \;
```

## B3.3: Platform Events

```bash
grep -rln "EventBus.publish" src/classes/ | xargs grep -l "ChangedClass"
```

## B3.4: Batch / Queueable / Scheduled

```bash
grep -rln "System.enqueueJob.*ChangedClass\|Database.executeBatch.*ChangedClass\|System.schedule.*ChangedClass" src/classes/
```

Save all to: `step_b3_integration.txt`

