## DEPENDENCY CHAIN

**[ChangedFile.cls]** — **[methodName()]** — [change description]
│
├─► **[CallerClass.cls]** — **callerMethod()** 🔴
│      [Why: uses old signature / depends on changed behavior]
│      │
│      └─► **[DeepCaller.cls]** — **method()** 🟡
│             [Why: depends on CallerClass output]
│
├─► **[CallerClass.cls]** — **callerMethod()** 🔴 (field availability)
│      Passes object to **[methodName()]** — **[FieldX__c]** not in SOQL SELECT
│      **[methodName()]** accesses **[FieldX__c]** → null at runtime → condition never true
│
└─► Frontend
       │
